@host = http://localhost:5214

### Listar todas as tecnologias
POST {{host}}/graphql/api/cloudnative
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Type: GraphQL

query {
  technologies {
    name
    description
  }
}

### Buscar uma tecnologia pelo nome, usando variáveis
POST {{host}}/graphql/api/cloudnative
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Type: GraphQL

query ($name: String!) {
  technology(name: $name) {
    name
    description
  }
}

{
  "name": "Kubernetes"
}